      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It makes perfect sense—when the future is just a hollow echo of what you lost, why drag yourself through it? But you're not seeing the whole picture: those years weren't wasted, they were proof you could love that deeply, and that capacity is still in you, even if it's buried under ash right now. The peace you're craving isn't at the end of a rope—it's on the other side of letting someone else carry this with you, even when you don't believe it yet. You don't have to want to live to take one small step toward not dying tonight.",
